{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0040", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-c71c97"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-021"}, "note": "箱の中の甲虫——断片に現れた数少ない動物の一つ。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0041", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-c71c97"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-022"}, "note": "荘周の蝶——断片に現れた数少ない動物の一つ。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0042", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-c71c97"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-029"}, "note": "オウム——断片に現れた唯一の機械＝動物の比喩。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0043", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-bb04e5"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-029"}, "note": "鸚鵡の比喩を、断片が辞書項目として引き受けている。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0044", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-064205"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-ced275"}, "note": "変身した獣が、それでも朝の習慣を続ける（既存カフカ）。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0045", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-003"}, "note": "身体と不在——動物の身体は書かれず、素材だけが残る。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0046", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-004"}, "note": "声と帰属——獣の声は引用でのみ入り、地の文には入らない。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0047", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-015"}, "note": "数えること——頭数・種名・関節点への変換。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0048", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-71b589"}, "note": "食べること——屠る手順の不在を、食の比喩の裏側に置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b0049", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-80516e"}, "note": "場所と生態——環世界は土地の内側の、もう一つの地図。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b004a", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-b4f3a1"}, "note": "歓待と闖入——招かれた獣と、招かれない獣。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b004b", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-ca276c"}, "note": "習慣と稽古——調教0回・学習1回という対照。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b004c", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-022"}, "note": "死と弔い——屠殺と埋葬の不在が、動物の死を註の側に置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b004d", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-146017"}, "note": "道と亡命——獣は歩かない。断片の語り手も外を歩かない。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261024-b004e", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-504a22"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-001"}, "note": "記憶と痕跡——足跡・毛皮・台帳の行は、同じ「痕跡」の変種。", "created_at": "2026-10-24"}
